OL,3,AMore than 12 US military aircraft leave
OL,4,Asecond UK base
OL,5,
OL,6,FDowning Street has insisted British air
OL,7,Fbases are safe and that their security
OL,8,Fis a "top priority".
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/40
